{"key":"apphycm-mcq-025","model":"google/gemini-3.8-flash","sample":1,"ok":true,"label":{"chosen_label":"B","working":"The differential equation m dv/dt = -bv rearranges to dv/dt = -(b/m)v. The solution is v(t) = v_0 e^(-(b/m)t) = v_0 e^(-t/tau). The characteristic decay time (time constant tau) is tau = m/b.","more_than_one_defensible_choice":false,"scope_verdict":"fully_in_scope","out_of_scope_concepts":[],"primary_topic_code":"2.9","required_units":[2],"difficulty":"Easy"},"usage":{"inputTokens":16149,"inputTokenDetails":{"noCacheTokens":16149,"cacheReadTokens":0},"outputTokens":359,"outputTokenDetails":{"textTokens":164,"reasoningTokens":195},"totalTokens":16508,"raw":{"thoughtsTokenCount":195,"promptTokenCount":16149,"candidatesTokenCount":164,"totalTokenCount":16508,"trafficType":"ON_DEMAND","promptTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":16149}],"candidatesTokensDetails":[{"modality":"TEXT","tokenCount":164}]},"reasoningTokens":195,"cachedInputTokens":0},"ms":3474,"error":""}
